    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d136">

                <pb facs="0217" n="205" sameAs="frus:frus1944v03/pg205"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">847.24/768b: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Australia</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-01-14T20:00:00-04:00">January 14, 1944—8
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>6. FEA is agreeable to your assuring the Australian authorities that no
                    commodities other than those listed in Exhibit A<anchor n="50" xml:id="d136-f1"
                    /> will be requested during the present calendar year and that the dollar
                    amounts listed are substantially accurate. It has not yet been possible to
                    determine the dollar amount of requirements of hides but this is not believed to
                    be an important item.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
